    "below were captured from the Python. This file is duplicated verbatim in",
    "both repositories (smart-home-solutions and shs-ha-integration) because CI",
    "cannot reach across them; each repo asserts its own implementation against",
    "it. Change the calculation and BOTH copies must be regenerated, or one",
    "repo's suite fails - which is the point.",
